<title>UK: Argentina will delay $750 mln global bond issue.</title>
<headline>Argentina will delay $750 mln global bond issue.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina has decided to delay the launch of a planned $750 million seven-year global bond issue due to market volatility, joint lead manager Credit Suisse First Boston said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>On Monday Argentina had said it would launch the deal &quot;in the near future&quot; via joint lead managers CSFB and SBC Warburg. No further terms were given.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7748</p>
</text>
